{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:44 2026-09-13 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:44 2026-09-13 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:44 2026-09-13 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/302bba9b0adf61b1fcf9ed038104ea4c/2026-09/44.png\"/><p>今（13日）晨11時許，一輛嶼巴 Volvo B8L駛至深圳灣口岸時突然失控自炒，剷上路壆撞毀一棵大樹，另一棵樹被壓至傾斜，巴士上層擋風玻璃爆裂，慶幸沒有人受傷，意外原因待調查。</p><img alt=\"巴士撞毀大樹，擋風玻璃爆裂。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/22eab7d1b12c00a96300c02bab1b9f6c/2026-09/01_4_12.jpg\"/><img alt=\"巴士失控自炒撞大樹。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0680cb63a5137f4c22f6cc5c5a77ede5/2026-09/02_6_13.jpg\"/><img alt=\"巴士失控自炒撞大樹。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95f2956b1aa5d91db29bd879b44703f7/2026-09/03_1_20.jpg\"/><img alt=\"巴士失控自炒撞大樹。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d4c1fd6ecfed3c39a61b9e146ef2062/2026-09/04_3_16.jpg\"/><img alt=\"巴士失控自炒撞大樹。網圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f70ddcf28f3309aa2090ed41590cd494/2026-09/05_5_21.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T04:18:34.982532+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}